			"Message": "docs(Land): Update shim documentation URLs to editor.land domain\n\nFix two stale documentation links in the experimental shim tier table within the top-level README. The Low-Level Shim and Coverage/Telemetry Shim doc URLs pointed to the deprecated `land.playform.cloud` domain; point them to the canonical `editor.land` domain instead.\n\nNo functional change — purely a documentation link correction.",
