			"Message": "docs(Land): Add experimental shim tier documentation to README\n\nDocument the new two-tier interception system — Low-Level Shim (orange, engine\nprototype monkey-patches) and Coverage/Telemetry Shim (blue, ServiceCollection +\nIPC routing) — in a comparitive table in the Architecture section of the top-level\nREADME.\n\nIncludes tier values (`TierShim=Own|Preempt` vs `TierShim=Proxy|Replace`),\ncoverage statistics, overhead estimates, and links to full documentation and the\nexperimental task plan.\n\nGated behind the `TierShim` environment variable (default: `None`).",
